OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA bright start for Edinburgh
OL,6,Fand the Lothian's, cloudy elsewhere. A
OL,7,Fmainly dry day although rather cloudy
OL,8,Fat times. Outbreaks of rain possible
OL,9,Ffor Dumfries & Galloway later in the
OL,10,Fafternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA cloudy evening with some
OL,13,Flight rain or drizzle at times in the
OL,14,Fwest. Showers developing in the west,
OL,15,Fturning heavy for a time as they move
OL,16,Feast.
OL,17,
OL,18,CSunday:FShowery on Sunday with heavy
OL,19,Fspells and a risk of thunder, some
OL,20,Fdrier periods too, with some sunny
OL,21,Fspells in the west in the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
