OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FAn
OL,6,Funsettled start to the week with
OL,7,Fperiods of showers and rain, perhaps
OL,8,Fsome brighter conditions later
OL,9,FTuesday, a little uncertain by midweek
OL,10,Fbut risk of strong winds and rain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
